SHOT 6s | __camera__
The scene begins exactly as in <Picture 1>. Then {a light breeze moves hair, fabric and leaves|dust drifts slowly through the light|the light shifts slowly as a cloud passes}, and the main subject {slowly turns toward the camera|blinks and takes a slow breath|looks up at something above the frame}.
